        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebindi byonabyona Solomoni bye yakola, okuva lwe yainhama okufuga okutuuka ku nkomerero ye, byaghandiikibwa mu Byafaayo bya Nathani Omulanzi, ni mu Byalangibwa Ahiya ow'e Shilo, ni mu Byali mu Kubonekerwa kwa Iddo Omulanzi nga bigema ku Yeroboamu mutabane wa Nebati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entangama Solomoni ye yamala ng'afuga Isiraeli yoonayoona mu Yerusalemu, yali ya myaka makumi ana (40). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Solomoni oyo yaafa yeeyimba ku badhaadha be abaafa, yaaziikibwa mu kyetebwa Ekibuga kya Daudi lata we. Mutabane we Rehoboamu yaamusikira ku bwakyabazinga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.31"
            ]
          }
        }
